End to end (large, -fanout=2): retry.Do over txm.WithTx over a closure calling execute; the result is wrapped
"transfer %d: %w", an audit failure is joined, and the success path ends in bus.Notify, which swallows everything.
Expect execute's set behind "transfer %d: %w" (also joined with rollback errors), begin errors behind "tx: begin: %w",
ErrGaveUp, and audit.ErrClosed/ErrFull/write errors behind errors.Join. NO event-handler origin
(opaque "cli: more than %d transfers", the handler's *ValidationError{Field: "id"}, "needs review").
